00:34:10.650 --> 00:34:13.270
JOHN WILKES: That's a great
question I'm going to duck.

00:34:13.270 --> 00:34:14.530
FRANCESC CAMPOY: OK.

00:34:14.530 --> 00:34:14.929
MARK MANDEL: So you know what?

