FRANCESC CAMPOY:
Thank you very much.

00:34:21.590 --> 00:34:22.965
MARK MANDEL: Thank
you very much.

00:34:22.965 --> 00:34:25.020
FRANCESC CAMPOY: So
thanks so much again

00:34:25.020 --> 00:34:27.860
